<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Akakolintu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa jhukutumbula jha Pauli kwa Akakolintu</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Akakolintu</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Akak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa jhukutumbula jha Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akakolintu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa jhukutumbula jha Pauli jhijhandikwe na ntenga jwa Pauli pakate jha muchaka cha makome nhwano na nhwano kubhoke Yecho Kilichitu pabhelwika, mu chula jha 1:1. Jhenje ndi ikibha baluwa jhukutumbula pakate jha baluwa ibhele ya Pauli ikajhandikwe na Pauli kwa makunde gha bhando ghhighannyeketii Kilichitu gha ku Kolintu. Akajhandike baluwa jhenje pakibha atamita ku Epecho kabula jha kuhamuu kutyangila ku Kolintu, pakibha ajhahwila na kubhujha ku Makedoniya, mu chula jha 16:5-9.</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa jhenje ndi Pauli ajhanguu malobhe gha jhiletitwe na bhando kwa bhange, malobhe ghighalongelwa ghighateii na kikunde cha bhando chikinnyeketii Kilichitu, gwanganandela gwenio ndi mpechengano na ngongola. Muche gwa ku Kolintu ukamanyikine hake kwa ngongola, yenio lijhambu lya yakukangacha kwa kikunde cha bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu kwa mambu gheniya. Helahela baluwa jhenje jha kutumbula kwa bhando bha ku Kolintu, mu chula jha 13 ghabhii malobhe gha upalu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli abhajhambucha bhando bha ku Kolintu na innomba Chapanga kwa nhwalo gwabhe, mu chula jha 1:1-9.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ilonge malobhe gha mpechengano pakate jha likunde lilinnyeketii Kilichitu lya kwenio ku Kolintu, mu chula jha 1:10-4: 21.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ilongelela malobhe gha ngongola na kupelekana pamihalo bhene kwa bhene, mu chula jha 5-6.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ilongelela malobhe gha ipwatilila panane jha kutolelana, helahela mapwatalilo panane jha kupiya litambiko kwa inyagho na mapwatalilo panane jha kuyoka, mu chula jha 7-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ijhomolela kwa kukilongelela jwenio na mahengo ghake, mu chula jha 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Nenga Napauli, jhungemitwe kubhehe natenga jwa Kilichitu Yecho kwa kupala Chapanga, na nnongo gwito Sositenesi.<verse eid="1CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>Tunyandikile mangota ma bhando bhumunyeketii Chapanga bhumii ku Kolintu, mangota nhengitwe kubhehe bhanyahinyahi mu kulombana na Kilichitu Yecho, pamonga na bhando bhoha popoha bhubhannyopa Bhambo gwito Yecho Kilichitu.<verse eid="1CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>Ninyope umbone na uteeke kuhumii kwa Chapanga Tate gwito na Bhambo Yecho Kilichitu.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mota ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Ninchenguu Chapanga kwa machiko ghoha kwa nhwalo gwino mangota mme na umbone gwake kwa ndela jha Kilichitu Yecho. <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Nhwalo, kwa kulombana na Kilichitu, mangota nnyambulile ilebhe yoha. Nnyambulile mukulonge na kumanya. <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>Nhwalo malobhe gha uchakaka gha Kilichitu ghajhemite mbone nkate jhino. <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>Hilu mpungokilwe jhe na hupo jhojhoha kubhoke kwa Uhuke gwa Chapanga, kongo mmii mu kunendelela Bhambo gwito Yecho Kilichitu papala kubhonekana. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Jwenio nakangamalicha mangota ade lichiko lya kujhomolela, nkotoka kubhonekana kubhehe na ulemo lichiko lela lya Bhambo gwito Yecho Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>Chapanga ndi jwahobholeka, jwenio ankemite mangota maghumba nde na Mwana mundo Yecho Kilichitu, Bhambo gwito.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpechanganiko gwa bhando bhubhannyeketii Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Makalongo bhango, ninyopa kwa liina lya Bhambo gwito Yecho Kilichitu, nnyilane kwa kila kilebhe chimulongela, panga mpechangano pakate jhino, mme na liwacho limo na lilobhe limo. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Makalongo bhango, bhando bhange kubhoke munyumba jha Kuloe bhanobhalile mangota mjhangulana jhe. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Nipala kulonge chenje, kila jhumo alonge lyake, jhumo alonge, “Nenga naningekama Pauli,” na jhonge alonge, “Nenga naningengama Apolu,” na jhonge ilonge, “Nenga naningengama Kefa,” na jhonge alonge, “Nenga naningengama Kilichitu.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Bho, Kilichitu apechanganike? Bho, Pauli ndi jwakabhambitwe panchalaba kwa nhwalo gwino? Bho, makabatichwe mme bhabholwa bha Pauli?<verse eid="1CO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Ninchenguu Chapanga nhwalo nikabatiche jhe mundo jhojhoha mu lilongo lino nambo Kilisipo na Gayo tugha. <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>Yene mundo jhojhoha akotoka kulonge akabatichwe kwa liina lyango. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>Ngohe ngombwike! Helahela nakabatiche Sitefano na bhando bhibhakibha nkate jhake, nambo nikomboka jhe anda nikambatiche mundo jhonge. <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Kilichitu akandumite jhe nenga kubaticha, nambo andumite kwatangachii bhando Malobhe gha Mbone, changahobholela bhando bhina malango, nhwalo likakala lya kuwe kwake Kilichitu pa nchalaba kibhonekana kilebhe nacho.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilichitu ndi likakala na malango gha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Nhwalo malobhe gha kuwe kwa Yecho Kilichitu pa nchalaba ndi kilebhe cha ndindilima kwa bhala bhubhabhii mulilongo lya bhibhahobholela, nambo kwa twenga bhutughombokoka, tulibhona likakala lya Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Nhwalo Majhandiko gha Chapanga ghalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Chahangabhana malango ghabhe kwa bhando bhubhabhii na malango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">nu kumanya kwabhe chandaghila kutale.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Bho, bhabhii ko, bhando bhubhabhii na malango? Bho, bhabhii ko, bhabhola bha malaghalikilo? Bhabhii ko bhina malango hake? Chapanga alangi njwe malango gha bhando bha nnema ghongo kubhehe undindilima.<verse eid="1CO 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Kwa malango gha Chapanga, ihotoleka jhe bhando kummanya Chapanga kwa malango ghabhe, Chapanga akapahi kwakombola bhala bhubhajheketii kupete malobhe ghatutangachila, malobhe ghala ghughabhonekana undindilima kwa bhando bhina malango. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Akayahude bhapala ikangacho, na Akagilike bhapala malango. <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>Nambo twenga tuntangacha malobhe gha Kilichitu jwabhambitwe panchalaba. Kibhonekana kingobhahe kwa Akayahude, na undindilima kwa bhando bha ilambo henge. <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>Nambo kwa bhala bhubhakemitwe na Chapanga, bhoha Akayahude na Akagilike, Kilichitu ndi likakala lya Chapanga na malango gha Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Nhwalo chikibhonekana undindilima kwa Chapanga, kibhii na malango kupeta malango gha mundo, na chikibhonekana kikwete jhe makakala kwa Chapanga, kibhii na makakala kuliku makakala gha bhando.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Makalongo bhango, ngohe nkomboke pingemitwa na Chapanga, bhamahele pakate jhino mukibha jhe na malango kulengana na mawacho gha bhando, bhamahele jhe bhumukibha na likakala amu bhando bhumukibha aakolongwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Nambo Chapanga akahagwile ilebhe ya pannema ibhonekane ya undindima, kupala kwapeke hone bhubhabhii na malango, Chapanga akahagwii ilebhe ileghelike kupala kwapeke hone bhala bhubhakwete makakala. <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>Chapanga ahagwii ilebhe ibhonekana ipechelike na bhando na ghala ghabhonekana kilebhe nacho na yanganandela, kupala kughahangabhana ghighabhonekana na bhando kubhehe makolongwa pannema. <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>Chapanga akatehi yenio kupala mundo jhojhoha akotoka kukiloka palonge jhake. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Chapanga ndi jwanombaniche mangota na Kilichitu Yecho. Chapanga antei Kilichitu kubhehe malango ghito, kwa ndela jhake twenga tujhelanichwa na Chapanga, tubhehe bhando bha nyahinyahi na kughombokoka. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>Bhahe, ngita chighalongela Majhandiko gha Chapanga, “Jwapala kukiloka, na alokela lihengo lya Bhambo.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="s">Lilobhe panane jha Yecho jwabhambitwe panchalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Makalongo bhango, nenga pahikita kwino nikatumii jhe malobhe makolongwa na malango gha bhando kutangacha chile jha Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Nhwalo panikibha na mangota nikapahijhe kumanya chochoha nga Yecho Kilichitu kanjika, jhola jwabhambitwe panchalaba. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Panikibha kwino nikibha leghele, nikalendime kwa kujhoghopa hake. <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>Mabholo ghango na matangacho ghango nongila jhe kwa malobhe gha kuhutila bhando bhina malango, nambo ghakibha na likakala lya Uhuke gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>Ndehila naha nipala kihobholelo chino kikotoka kubhehe jhe mu malango gha bhando nambo itame mu makakala gha Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malango gha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Nambo tutangacha malobhe gha malango kwa bhala bhubhakomii muhuke, nambo malango ghanga chi gha pamba pannema, hilu chi gha malango gha ilongoche bha nnema ghongo bhubhabhii mu lilongo lya kuhobhelela. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Tutangacha malango gha Chapanga ghighaihitwe, Chapanga akahagwii kabula jha nnema kupanganwa kwa nhwalo gwa ung'alicho gwito. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Bhabhijhe akakolongwa bha nnema ghongo bhubhamanya malango ghanga. Ngaumanya bhakoto kummamba pa nchalaba Bhambo jwa ung'alicho. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>Nambo ngita chighalonge Majhandiko gha Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Mambu ghala liho inahwaijhe kulola, na lichikilo inawahijhe kujhoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">mambu gha bhando ahwachite jhe mu mwojho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">gheniya ndi Chapanga aghabhekite kwa bhala bhubhampahile.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Gheniya ndi mambu Chapanga akatujhogholile kwa ndela jha Uhuke gwa Chapanga. Nhwalo Uhuke gwa Chapanga alingukiya kila kilebhe ade mambu gha nkate jha Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Ghane jwahotola kumanya mambu gha nkate jha mundo nga uhuke gwake mundo jwenio? Helahela abhii jhe jwamanya mambu gha Chapanga nga Uhuke gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Bhahe, twenga tupokiijhe uhuke gwa nnema, nambo tupokii Uhuke ghuhumita kwa Chapanga kupala kumanya ghala ghatupekei jhajhe Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Bhahe, twenga tubhola chi kwa malobhe kwa malango gha bhando bhahoto kubhola, nambo tulonge panane jha mambu ghanga kwa malobhe gha Uhuke gwa Chapanga ibhola, tuchimulila ilebhe ya Kihuke gwa Chapanga kwa bhando bhubhabhii na Kihuke. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Mundo jwangabhehe na Uhuke gwa Chapanga ahoto jhe kughamanya mambu ghala ghighahumita kwa Chapanga, nhwalo ghibhonekana undindima kwa jwenio na amanyita jhe, nhwalo ghamanyikina kwa kutangatilwa na Uhuke gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Nambo mundo jwakwete Uhuke gwa Chapanga, ahoto kughamanya ghoha, na abhii jhe jhonge jwahoto kunhadabhula. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>Majhandiko gha Chapanga ghalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">“Ghane jwahoto kumanya malango gha Bhambo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Ghane jwahoto kunnongocha Bhambo?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Nambo twenga tuwacha ngita Kilichitu chiihwacha.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Lihengo lya bhabhola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Makalongo bhango, nenga nikahotwii jhe kulonge na mangota anda nilonge na bhando bhubhakwete Uhuke gwa Chapanga. Nipalwa kulonge na mangota anda bhando bha nnema, ngita yana ilemba mu kihobholelo cha Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Nipekii mabhele, na chi chakulyegha kijhundupaho, nhwalo ngauhotwii jhe kulyegha. Helahela ngohe mihoto jhe kulyegha. <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>Nhwalo mangota mwamela mitama ngita bhando bha kiyegha chibhatama. Bho, chakaka jhe kubhehe ubhii wiho na bhulo pakate jhino? Mambu ghanga ghalangii chakaka kubhehe mangota ndi bhando bha nnema, mitama ngita bhando bha nnema chibhatama. <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Jhumo gwino palongela, “Nenga ninkengama Pauli,” na jhonge, “Nenga ninkengama Apolu” Bho, muhenga jhe ngita chibhahenga bhando bha nnema?<verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Apolu ndi ghane? Na Pauli ndi ghane? Twenga ndi akatumiche bha Chapanga kupete lihengo lito mangota nkwete kihobholelo, na kila mundo ahenga lihengo lyapatite na Bhambo. <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>Nenga nikamichite mbejho, Apolu ajhitilile mache, nambo jwamelecha mbejho ndi Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Jwamicha mbejho na jhola jwajhitilila mache, kilebhe nacho nambo Chapanga kanjika ndi nkolongwa jwaitenda imele. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Mundo jhola jwamichite mbejho na jhola jwajhitilila mache bhoha bhahengite kilebhe chimo, nambo Chapanga channepa malepo kila mundo kwa lihengo lyake. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Nhwalo twenga tuhenga mahengo pamonga na Chapanga, na mangota ndi nng'onda gwa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Mangota ndi nyumba jha Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Kwa utangatilo gwa umbone gwa Chapanga, nimekite nchinge ngita mundo jwahoto kuchenga mbone, na mundo jhonge kuchenga panane jhake. Nambo kila mundo jwapala kuchenga akilolekiye papala kuchenga panane jhake. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Abhii jhe mundo jhonge jwahoto kubheka nchinge ghonge kuliku ghola ghubhekitwe, ndi Yecho Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Panane jha nchinge gwenio, mundo jhumo jwahoto kuchenga kwa chaabo, amu kuchenga kwa feza amu kuchenga kwa maghanga gha mbijha ngolongwa, amu kuchenga kwa mikongo, amu kuchenga kwa mahamba amu manyahe. <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>Kwa ndela jhojhoha jhambone jha lihengo lya kila mundo chilibhonekana hotu, mu machiko ghala gha Kilichitu. Nhwalo lichiko lyenio mwotu chaupema kila lihengo lya mundo, na mwotu gwenio naujhigha ngita lyambone. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Anda lihengo lya mundo jwenio litinike jhe pamwotu, mundo jwenio chapata hupo, <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>nambo anda chachengite kitinike, bhahe, mundo jwenio najhambulii jhe kilebhe, nambo jwenio chakombwilwe anda aholwite mu mwotu.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Bho, mu manyajhe mangota ndi Nyumba jha Chapanga, na Uhuke gwa Chapanga atama nkate jhino? <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Bhahe, mundo jwahangabhana Nyumba jha Chapanga, Chapanga chahangabhana mundo jwenio. Nhwalo Nyumba jha Chapanga ndi nyahinyahi, na nyumba jhene ndi mangota mabhene.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Nkoto kukikolowa mabhene! Mundo jhojhoha pakate jhino jwawacha kubhehe jhuna malango gha pannema, mbaha kubhonekana lindindilima kupala kubhehe na malango chakaka. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>Nhwalo, malango gha nnema ghongo ndi undindima palonge jha Chapanga. Helahela Majhandiko gha Chapanga ghalonge, “Chapanga ajhakwakamula bhubhabhii na malango mukukalamuka kwabhe.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>Kabhele Majhandiko ghange ghalonge, “Bhambo amanya kubhehe mawacho gha bhala bhubhabhii na malango kuchata jhe.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Bhahe, mundo nkotoka kukilokela ghala ghibhahenga bhando. Nhwalo kila kilebhe ndi chino. <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>Abhe Pauli amu abhe Apolu amu Kefa, amu nnema amu ughome amu kuwe, mambu gha chaa jhenje amu ghala ghighapala kuhika palonge, nhwalo ghoha ndi ghino. <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>Nambo mangota ndi bhando bha Kilichitu, na jwenio Kilichitu ndi jwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Akatenga bha Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Kila mundo amanye kubhehe twenga ndi akatumiche bha Kilichitu, tupilwe chile jha Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Chikipalwa kuhenga kwa mundo jhojhoha jhola jwahengita lihengo lende ndi kubhehe jhuna kihobholelo. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Kwa nenga kilebhe jhe kuhadabulwa na mangota, amu na udamo gwa pannema, hilu nikihadabula jhe namwene. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Ku mwojho gwango ngwete jhe matakalilo kwa lijhambu lyolyoha, nambo ilangii jhe ngwete jhe jwangokolekeya. Bhambo ndi jwahoto kuhadabula. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Bhahe, nkotoka kunhadabhula mundo kabula jha lichaa lyake, muneke ade Bhambo papakuhika. Jwenio chahumbula mambu ghoha ghughabhii mulubhendo, na kubheka hotu ghughabhii umiojho jha bhando. Peniya kila mundo chapata ulumbililo ghutopela kubhoke kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Makalongo bhango, nintumii Apolu na nenga namwene nhwalo kupete nnandanikiho ghongo mukibhole malobhe ghanga, “Nkamule ghughabhii mu majhandiko ghango.” Nkotoka kukilokela kwa mundo jhumo na kunpucha jhonge. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Ghane jwantehi mwenga kubhehe makolongwa kuliku bhange? Bho, Chapanga ammanyite jhe ilebhe yunkwete? Bho, anda mpatite nike chimukilokela anda mpokii jhe?<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Bho, ngohe mpatite yoha imuipala? Bho, ngohe nkwete ilebhe mbwe? Mmii akanahota panga twenga! Chakaka, nipala mme akanahota ngita twenga mukulongocha pamonga na mangota. <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Niwacha Chapanga atutehi twenga twakatenga bha bhando bha pahe, ngita bhando bhubhahadabwilwe kuwe, nhwalo tubhii anda unyagho palonge jha nnema ghoha, palonge jha akatumiche bha kunane kwa Chapanga na bhando. <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Twenga ndi akamandindilima nhwalo gwa kuntumikila Kilichitu, nambo mangota nkwete malango mu kulombana na Kilichitu! Tubhonekana bhando bhubhabhii leghele! Nambo mangota nkwete makakala! Mangota mitopela! Nambo twenga tubhonekana kupecheleka! <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Ade ngoheno, twenga tukwete njala na nyota, tukwetejhe ngobho, tutyalwa, ngwetejhe pakutama. <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>Kabhele tubhikulagha hake kuhenga lihengo kwa mabhoko ghito twabhete. Putuligwa, twenga twajhopela mota, putung'ahika, twenga tuhimbalila, <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>Putuligwa twenga tujhangula mbone. Ade ngoheno tubhonekana ngita luku lwa nnema, na kwa kila mundo tubhonekana uchapo!<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Nijhandika ndeka mambu ghanga kupala kwapeke hone, nambo nibhola ngita yana yango inipahile. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Ata ngabhehe akayaya elufo kome mu kulombana na Kilichitu, nambo tate gwino ndi jhumo, nhwalo mu kulombana na Yecho Kilichitu nenga ndi tate gwino jwa kunnetela Malobhe gha Mbone. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Ngohe, nipembelekeya chonde, nkengame nnandanikiho gwango. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Kwa kuntangatila nintuma Timocheyo kwino. Jwenio ndi mwana gwango mu kulombana na Bhambo Yecho Kilichitu, jhunimpala na jwahobholeka. Jwenio nankombocha ndela jhiniikengama nenga mu kulombana na Kilichitu. Ndela jhibhola kila chehemo kwa bhando bhoha bhubhannyeketii Kilichitu.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Bhando bhange pakate jhino bhatumbwile kuloka na kulonge nahikajhe kabhele kwino. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Nambo, anda Bhambo apahile, chahika kwino kajhombe, peniya ndi chanikinolela namwete chi chela chimilonge majhito bhibhaloka, nambo makakala ghughabhehe nako. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Nhwalo unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga chi malobhe tugha, nambo ndi likakala. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Bho, kilebhe ghane chikinhalalila? Bho, hike kwino nayato amu hike na mwojho gwa upalo na utokomalo?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Mwibhambale ngongola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Ghabhii malobhe gha uchakaka kubhehe bhabhii akatenda ngongola pakate jhino, kabhele ngongola yenio inapitila jhe hilu kwa bhando bhangaummanya Chapanga. Nobholilwe kubhehe jhumo gwino igholoka na mwikeghe jwa tate mundo! <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Nauhotola bhole kuloka? Mbaha kwino kubhehe ngolongondi, na mundo jwahenga mambu gheniya abhengwa pakate jhino. <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Na nenga, kiyegha mii kutale na mangota, nambo kiuhuke tubhii pamonga, anda mmi pakate jhino ninhadabwii njwe kwa liina lya Bhambo Yecho mundo jwenio jwahengite mambu gheniya gha hone. <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>Pumukonganika pamonga, na nenga mmii na mangota mu uhuke gwango, na likakala lya Bhambo gwito Yecho ibhii peniya, <verse eid="1CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>mundo jwenio munkamuye kwa Limbembela kupala yegha jhake ihangalabhanwe na uhuke gwake ukombolelwe lichiko lela Bhambo papakuhika kwahadabuu bhando.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Kuloka kwino kuchata jhe! Bho, umanyitii jhe kubhehe kimela chandina kituta libuluma lya ukobha? <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>Mukijhelebhuhe kwa kuileka ngedule gha makacho jha uhakaho na mme mukumuku. Peniya nanandana na libuluma liyono lyangabhekwa ngedule. Ngita chimupalwa kubhehe. Nhwalo, Kilichitu ndi jwabhii Pachaka abhohitwe kubhehe litambiko. <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Bhahe, tuhenge unyagho gwenio gwa Pachaka, chi kwa libumunda lya makacho, kimela cha ulemo na ubhoho. Nambo kwa libumunda lyangalekelwa ngedule, ndi mwojho gwambone na uchakaka.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Nikanyandikile mu baluwa jhango jhenge, nkoto kuhangalwana nako bhibhatenda ngongola. <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Nilonge jhe kubhehe nkoto kuhangalwa nabho bhando bhangaummanya Chapanga, akatenda ngongola na bhubhapoka ilebhe na bhubhajhima na bhubhalongela uwange na bhubhaijhinamii inyagho. Nhwalo, kupala kwabhambala bheniya ndi ipalwa kubhoka pamba pannema! <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Nambo ngohe ninyandikila nkoto kuhangalwanwa na mundo jhojhoha jwalonge anyeketela Kilichitu kone ndi ntenda ngongola na nnyime, ajhinamii inyagho na jhuna maligho na jwalobhela na jwapoka ilebhe. Mundongita jwenio nkoto kulye nako.<verse eid="1CO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Bho, ndi lihengo lyango kwahadabhula bhando bhubhabhii panja jha bhubhannyeketii Kilichitu? Bho, mangota mipalwa ndeka kwahadabhula bhando bhubhabhii pakate jhino mabhene? <verse eid="1CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Nambo Chapanga jwenio nabhahadabula bhando bheniya bhibhabhii panja jha bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu, ngita Majhandiko gha Chapanga chighalonge, “Mabhenge kutale bheniya bhibhatenda ubhoho pakate jhino.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s">Kutakalilana kwa akalongo bhubhajheketii Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Mundo anda abulana na nnyake, naibhabho jhumo kuntakalila pa Bwalo jha bhando bhangaummanya Chapanga kuneka kuntakalila kwa bhando bha Chapanga? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Bho, mmanyii jhe kubhehe bhando bha Chapanga chibhauhadabula nnema? Anda mangota uhoto kunhadabula nnema, nhwalo ghane mihoto jhe kuhadabula kwa mambu machokomachoko? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Bho, mmanyii jhe kubhehe, mangota chamwahadabula akatumiche bha kunane kwa Chapanga? Bhahe, mangota mihoto kuhadabula kuchocha mambu gha ughome ghongo. <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Pumibhehe na bhulo, bho, mwakema jhe bhando bhangabhehe na ukindendeke kwa bhando bhangannyeketii Kilichitu bhanhadabule? Bho, akajhomola mihalo ndi bhando bhangabhehe na ukindendeke kwa bhando bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu? <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Nilonge naha mbala nkole hone mabhene! Bho, abhii jhe jhumo pakate jhino jwakwete malango kuhoto kujhomola mihalo pakate jha bhubhannyeketii Kilichitu? <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Nambo mundo jwanyeketii Kilichitu ajhakunneta pa bwalo na kwaleka bhando bhangaummanya Chapanga bhahadabule!<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Ibhonekana kutakalilana mabhene kwa mabhene pa bwalo ilangii nnepelile. Bho, kilebhe chambone jhe kwino kuhimbalila ghanganandela? Bho, chambone jhe kwino kupokwa ilebhe hino? <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Nambo mangota ndi mwatendela ghanganandela na kwapoka, kabhele, gheniya mwatendela bhajhino bhibhanyeketii Kilichitu! <verse eid="1CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Bho, mmanyite jhe kubhehe bhando bhubhahenga ghanganandela nabhabhujhii jhe unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga? Mwangakolohana! Bhando bhubhahenga ngongola, bhubhajhinamii inyagho, amu bhubhagholoka na akanalome bhajhabhe, <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>wihe na bhibhapala ilebhe mbwe na bhubhalobhela ughembe na bhubhang'wenya, bhubhakopekeya bhange na bhubhaligha, bheniya bhoha chibhabhujhii jhe unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Bhange pakate jhino mukibha ngita bhando bheniya. Nambo ngoheno nnekekiwe uhakaho gwino, mmekitwe kubhehe mwa nyahinyahi, na kubhehe mmihobholeka palonge jha Chapanga kwa liina lya Bhambo Yecho Kilichitu na kwa Uhuke gwa Chapanga gwito.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yegha jhino inombe Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>Mundo ahoto kulonge, “Kila kilebhe kijhekitelwa kwa nenga.” Telatela, nambo chi kila kilebhe chambone kwa nenga. Nijheketela kubhehe nihoto kulongocha kila kilebhe nambo nipala jhe kubhehe napungwa kwa kilebhe chochoha. <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>Mihoto kulonge, “Chakulyegha ndi kwa nhwalo gwa lutumbo, na lutumbo ndi kwa nhwalo gwa chakulyegha.” Nambo Chapanga chahangabhana yoha. Yegha jha mundo chi kwa nhwalo gwa ngongola nambo kwa nhwalo gwa Bhambo, na Bhambo ndi kwa nhwalo jha yegha. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Chapanga jwayokiche Bhambo kubhoke mukuwegha, natuyokicha na twenga helahela kwa likakala lyake.<verse eid="1CO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Bho, mmanyitii jhe yegha hino ndi ihungo ya Kilichitu? Bho, miwacha nihoto kutola chehemo jha yegha jha Kilichitu na kuitenda kubhehe chehemo jha yegha jha mundo jwatenda ngongola? Nahi jhe! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Bho, umanyite jhe, jwalombana na mwikeghe jwatenda ngongola bhabhii yegha jhimo? Ngita chijhandikwe mu Majhandiko gha Chapanga, “Na bheniya bhabhele nabhabha yegha jhimo.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Nambo jhola jwalombana na Bhambo bhabhehe pamonga ki Uhuke.<verse eid="1CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Mibhambale ngongola. Uhakaho ghoha ghonge ghuhengwa panja jha yegha, nambo jwahenga ngongola ahutende uhakaho yegha jhake jwenio. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Bho, mmanyitii jhe kubhehe yegha hino ndi Nyumba jha Uhuke gwa Chapanga jwabhii nkate jhino, jhola mumpokii kubhoke kwa Chapanga? Bhahe, mangota chi gwino mabhene. <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>Nhemelilwe kwa bei ngolongwa. Ngoheno, munnombe Chapanga kwa yegha jhino.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s">Machwale gha kutolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Kwa nhwalo gwa ghala ghunyandike.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">Mbaha munalome akoto kutolela. <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Nambo kwa nhwalo gwa kubhambala ngongola, mbaha kila munalome abhehe na nhwana mundo, na kila mwikeghe abhehe na ungana mundo. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Munalome ahenge ghighapalwa kuhenga kwa nhwana mundo, na jwenio nhwana mundo ahenge ghighapalwa kuhenga kwa ungana mundo. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Nhwana mundo akwete jhe kindendeke panane jha yegha jhake, nambo ungana mundo akwete, helahela na jwenio munalome, akwete jhe kindendeke panane jha yegha jhake, nambo nhwana mundo akwete. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Kila mundo anganyima jhe nnyake, nambo anda nnyiline ntende pandina tugha, kupala nngongela kwa nhwalo gwa kunnyopa Chapanga. Peniya kila mundo amujhile nnyake kabhele, kupala kulibhambala Limbembela kwa nhwalo jha kubhehe gwangakamilika.<verse eid="1CO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Ghanga nilonge nenga, chi malaghalikilo, nipala ntame maha. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Nikapahile bhando bhoha bhabhehe ngita nenga, nambo kila mundo jhumo akwete kitoi chake kuhumii kwa Chapanga, jhumo kitoi chenje na jhonge chela.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Nambo kwa bhala bhangatolela amu bhibhatolile amu mapwela, nenga nilonge naha yamaha kujhendelela kutama uholo ngita nenga. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Nambo anda mundo ahoto jhe kuhimbilila, atolele, amu atolelwe mbaha kutolela amu kutolelwa kuliku kupala ngongola.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Kwa bhala bhubhatolile na bhubhatolilwe napela lilaghalikilo lende, chi lilaghalikilo lyango, nambo ndi lya Bhambo, mwikeghe akoto kunneka ungana mundo. <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>Nambo anda atei yenio, bhahe atame uholo, amu ajhelane nako ungana mundo. Helahela munalome akoto kunneka nhwana mundo.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Kwa bhando bhange, ne nilonge naha, nambo malobhe ghanga ghahumitii jhe kwa Bhambo. Anda munalome akwete nhwana mundo jwanganyekete Kilichitu, na jwenio nhwana mundo ajheketile kujhendelela kutama na ungana mundo, munalome akotoka kunneka nhwana mundo. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Anda mwikeghe akwete munalome jwanganyeketela Kilichitu, na jwenio ungana mundo ajheketile kujhendelela kutama na nhwana mundo, bhahe, mwikeghe jwenio akotoka kunneka ungana mundo. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Kwa nhwalo munalome jwangannyeketela Kilichitu napokelelwa na Chapanga kwa kulombana na nhwana mundo. Na mwikeghe jhola jwangannyeketela Kilichitu, Chapanga napokelelwa na Chapanga kwa kulombana na ungana mundo. Anda nahijhe yana yabhe ngaibhii ngita yana yangaummanya Chapanga, nambo ngohe chakaka bheniya ndi yana ya Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Anda mundo jwannyeketela Kilichitu apala kunneka nnyake jwanyeketela Kilichitu bhahe anneke tugha. Munalome amu mwikeghe jwannyeketela Kilichitu ahibhilikii jhe kutenda yenio. Chapanga atukemite twenga tutame kwa uteeke. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Mwe makeghe jhumujheketii Kilichitu, naumanya bho, anda namunkombola jhe ungana gwino? Amu mwenga manalome jhumujheketile Kilichitu naumanya bho namunkombola jhe nhwana gwino?<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ntame ngita chankemitwe na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Kila mundo atame tela na kitoi chapekiwe na Bhambo, na ngita akemitwe na Chapanga. Lyenio ndi lilaghalikio lyango kwa bhando bhubhannyeketii Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Anda mundo akemitwe na Chapanga kongo jwangajhingii jando, bhahe akotoka kukikopokeya ajhingii jhe jando. Anda mundo pakemitwa ajhingii jhe jando, bhahe akotoka kujhingii jando. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Nhwalo kujhingii jando amu changajhingii jando kilebhenacho, kilebhe kikolongwa ndi kukamula lilaghalikilo lya Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Bhahe, kila mundo na ahighilike ngita chakibha pakemitwa na Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Bho, mwenga pukemitwa na Chapanga mukibha jhe mmanda? Tela, nkotoka kupwelela, nambo anda mpatite pwache nhenge. <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Nhwalo jwenio jwakemitwa na Bhambo pakibha mmanda, jwenio jwalekekilwe na Bhambo. Helahela jwakemitwa kongo mmanda jhe, jwenio nabhaha mmanda jwa Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Chapanga aunhemile mangota kwa mbijha jhamahele, nkotoka kubhehe akabhanda bha bhando. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Makalongo bhango, kila mundo ajhendelele kutama na Chapanga, nhwalo Chapanga abhii pamonga na twenga.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malobhe gha bhando bhangatolela na mapwela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Ngohe kwa malobhe gha bhala bhubhatolile na bhangatolelwa, ngwete jhe lilaghalikio kuhumii kwa Bhambo, nambo nenga nilonge ghanga kwa kiya jha Bhambo nitope kuhobholeka.<verse eid="1CO 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Chinilola nenga mang'ahiko ghughahika, mbaha ahighilike ngita chakibha. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>Bho, ntolile? Bhahe, mangalogwa jhe kunneka. Bho, ntolii jhe? Mangalogwa jhe kutolela. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Nambo anda ntolile, naibhaha uhengite jhe uhakaho, anda nchikana atolilwe, ahengite jhe uhakaho, nambo bhala bhibhatola chibhapata mang'ahiko ghamahele mu ughome ghongo, na nenga nipala gheniya ghamambale mangota.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Nambo makalongo bhango, mbala kulonge naha, machiko ghahighilike ghandina. Kutumbula ngoheno bhala bhibhatolile na bhatame ngita bhala bhangatolela, <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>na bhubhalela bhabhehe anda bhangalela, na bhala bhibhaheka bhabhehe ngita bhangahangana. Na bhala bhibhahemela, ilebhe yenio ibhehe ngita yabhe jhe. <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>Na bhubhabhii mukukakalakana kupalaha ilebhe ya pannema pano bhabha ngita bhando bhangakakalakana. Nhwalo nnema ghongo anda tumanye utenda kupeta.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Nambo mbala mangota ntame changa kiholo. Mundo jwangatolela akakalakana lihengo lya Bhambo, kone ajhigha kunhalalicha Bhambo. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Nambo munalome jwatolile akakalakana mambu gha nnema, anhalaliche nhwana mundo, <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>ahutilwa na ilebhe ibhele. Mwikeghe jwangatolelwa ukakalakana na mambu gha Bhambo kupala abhehe nyahinyahi yegha na uhuke kwa Bhambo. Nambo jhola jwatolilwe ukakalakana na mambu gha nnema, kwa kunhalalila ungana mundo.<verse eid="1CO 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Nilonge naha nipala kuntangatila mangota, nipala jhe kuhibhilikiya kwa chochoha, nambo ntame ngita chiipalwa na kukibhoha mabhene mu mahengo gha Bhambo changahutilwa na mambu ghange.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Anda mundo alola ahenga mbone jhe kuntolela jhe mwikeghe jwannepii inyaghabhule, anda kuhimbilila chepa mbaha atole, anda antolile mwikeghe jwenio ahenga jhe uhakaho. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Anda munalome alola tela kutama changatolela na ahoto kuhimbalila, mmanya kubhehe ahenga mbone kutama changa tolela jwenio nchikana. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Jhola jwapala kutolela mwikeghe ahenga mbone, na jhola jwangatolela ahenga mbone hake.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Mwikeghe jwatolilwe apungitwe na ungana mundo anda abhii ughome. Nambo anda ungana mundo awile, bhahe mwikeghe jwenio ahoto kutolelwa na mwanalome jhonge jwampala, nambo abhehe jwanhobhelela Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Nambo panola nenga, mwikeghe jwenio nabhaha na luhangano hake anda ahighilike changatolelwa. Gheniya nilola nenga pange ngwete Uhuke gwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yakulyegha itambikilwe mahoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Ngohe kwa nhwalo gwa yakulyegha ikatambikilwe mahoka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">Tumanya kubhehe twenga twabhoha ilebhe henge, nambo kumanya kwenio kwabheka bhando kukiloka, nambo upalo uchenga. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>Jwawacha kubhehe amanya kilebhe, chakaka amela amanyite jhe chochoha anda chiipala kumanya. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Nambo mundo jwampahi Chapanga, jwenio amanyikine na jwenio.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Kwa gheniya, panane jha kulyegha itambikilwe mahoka, tumanya chakaka kubhehe inyagho kilebhenacho pannema, tumanya Chapanga ndi jhumo tugha. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Ata bhakabhii bheniya bhibhakemwa inyagho pannema amu kunane kwa Chapanga, ata bhakabhii inyagho na akanahota bhamahele, <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>kwito abhii Chapanga jhumo tugha, Tate, jwapangine ilebhe yoha, kwa nhwalo gwake twenga tutama. Helahela abhii Bhambo jhumo tugha, jwenio ndi Yecho Kilichitu, kwa kupete kwa jwenio ilebhe yoha ipanginwe, na twenga tutama kwa kupete jwenio.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Nambo, chi kila mundo jwamanya uchakaka ghongo. Bhando bhange bhayobhalile hake mahoka, ade deleno pubhalyegha yakulyegha itambikilwe mahoka uhobholela njwe mumiojho jhabhe kubhehe ipihitwe yakula yenio ya mahoka. Kwa uhotolo gwa kuhaghu ghambone na ghanganandela ukwetii jhe likakala bhahola yakulye yenio yatenda bhakota kujheketelwa palonge jha Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Nambo chakulye kihoto jhe kutubheka pahina na Chapanga. Anda tulekite kulyegha kibhii jhe chikipongoka, anda tulyegha kibhii jhe chikijhonjekeka.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Nambo mukilolekeye, pumulekekewa kuhenga ilebhe, nkoto kwatenda bhubhabhii na kihobholelo chandina bhatende uhakaho. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Nhwalo, mundo jwabhii na uhotolo gwandina gwa kuhaghula lyambone na libhoho, anda amwene mangota bhakwete kihobholelo kikolongwa mulyegha yakulya yenio nkate mwa nyumba jha inyagho, bho, chabhe jhe na mwojho gwa kulyegha yakulyegha itambikilwe mahoka? <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Ngohe, jwenio nnongo gwino jwabhii na uhotolo gwandina gwa kumanya lyamaha na libhoho, jhojho jwenio Kilichitu akawile kwa nhwalo gwake chahobhelela ndeka kwa nhwalo gwa kumanya kwino. <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Anda uhenga mambu gheniya kwa ajhino bhubhajheketii Kilichitu, na kuikocholana uhotolo ileghelike kwa kuhaghuu lyamaha na libhoho, mmanye uhenga uhakaho kwa Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Anda chakulye chinilyegha kintenda nnongo gwango ahenge uhakaho, nilyejhe nyama kabhele, ngoto kuntenda nnongo gwango agwe muhakaho.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Lihengo lya akatenga na ghibhapalwa kupelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Bho, ne nekekiwe jhe? Bho, ne natenga jhe? Bho, nenga nimwe jhe Yecho Bhambo gwito? Bho, mangota lihengo lyango jhe kwa kulombana na Bhambo? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Ata ikabhii kwa bhando bhange ne natenga jhe, nambo kwino mangota nenga ndi natenga. Mangota ndi mulangiya utenga gwango kwa nhwalo gwa kulombana kwino na Bhambo.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Naha chinikikengelela kwa bhando bhubhangonya, <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>bho, tupalwa ndeka kupelwa chakulye na chakunywegha kwa nhwalo gwa lihengo lito? <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Bho, tukwete jhe ukindendeke gwa kutolela mwikeghe jwahobholela Kilichitu mukutyanga, ngita chibhahenga akatenga bhange, akalongo bhake Bhambo, na Kefa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Amu ndi nenga na Banaba tugha tupalwa kupata ilebhe hito kwa kuhenga lihengo? <verse eid="1CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Bho, nkomana ngondo ghane jwalepa mbijha kwa lihengo lyake? Bho, nnema ghane jwangalyegha uhoe gwa nng'onda gwake gwa chambalau? Bho, nnucha ghane jwaikoleka jwanganywegha mabhele gha inyama yake?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Bho, nilonge malobhe ghanga kwa kimundo tugha? Bho, lilaghalikilo lya Mucha ilongela jhe naha? <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Nhwalo ijhandikwe mu lilaghalikilo lya Mucha, “Nkotoka kuntabha nnomo ng'ombi pabula mponga.” Bho, ibhii na mana Chapanga ilongelela ng'ombi? <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Bho, palongela gheniya alongii jhe panane jha malobhe ghito? Chakaka ghanga ghajhandikwe kwa nhwalo gwito, nhwalo jhola jwalema na jhola jwahuna, bhoha bhihobholela kupata mahuno. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>Anda twenga tumichita mbejho jha kiuhuke pakate jhino, bho, kilebhe kikolongwa twenga kupata ghitupala kuhumii kwino? <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Anda bhando bhange bhipalwa kupata gheniya kubhoke kwino, bho, twenga tupalwa jhe kupata kuliku bhene?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Nambo, twenga tuntumii jhe ukindendeke gwenio. Tuhimbilila mu kila kilebhe kupala Lilobhe lya Mbone lya Kilichitu likotoka kubhujha unyuma. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Bho, umanyingine jhe kubhehe bhubhahenga lihengo mu Nyumba jha Chapanga bhipata yakulegha mwenio, na bhubhabheka litambiko pakichangwale bhipata kilebhe mwenio mu litambiko? <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Helahela Bhambo akalaghalikiye naha, bhala bhibhatangachii bhando Lilobhe lya Mbone bhapate ilebhe yabhe ibhaipala kubhoke mwenio.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Nambo nikajhopite jhe hilu kilebhe chimo. Amu nikajhandike ndeka kupala undendele gheniya. Kwa nenga mbaha kuwegha kuliku kuntenda mundo anole anda nenga nikiloka jhajhe. <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Anda nenga nitangacha Malobhe gha Mbone, chenie kilebhe jhe cha kukiloka. Lyenio ndi lihengo limpekiwe. Chanola choto anda natangachii jhe bhando Lilobhe lya Mbone! <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Anda nihenga lihengo lende kwa kupala namwete, ngahobholile kulepwa, nambo anda nenga nipalwa kuhenga lihengo lende, ilangii kubhehe Chapanga ambekii nenga kuhenga lende. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Bho, malepo ghango kilebhe ghane? Panatangachii bhando nipala jhe kulepwa chochoha, nijhopa jhe malepo kwa lihengo lya kutangacha Lilobhe lya Mbone.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Nenga nabhanda jhe bha mundo jhojhoha. Nikibhekite nabhanda kwa kila mundo nhwalo kunnete Kilichitu bhando bha mahele. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Punikibha kwa Akayahude ndamita ngita Akayahude kupala kwapata Akayahude, pamonga na nenga kubhehe pahe jha lilaghalikilo lya Mucha, nambo nikibha ngita pahe jha lilaghalikilo lyenio, kupala kwapata bheniya bhubhabhii pahe jha lilaghalikilo lya Mucha. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Punikibha na bhando bhangalongochwa na lilaghalikilo lya Mucha, nikibha ngita bheniya ngita ngwetejhe lilaghalikilo, kupala kwapata bhala bhangabhehe na lilaghalikilo lya Mucha. Kulonge yenio nenga anda nikengama jhe lilaghalikilo lya Chapanga, nhwalo mbungwitwe na lilaghalikilo lya Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Punikibha na bhando bhala bhubhabhii leghele nikatamite helahela ngita chibhabhii bhene, kupala kwapata bhene bhubhabhii leghelike. Nikitehi kila kilebhe kwa bhando bhoha kupala kwakombola kwa ndela jhojhoha jhela.<verse eid="1CO 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Hengite ghanga ghoha kwa nhwalo gwa Lilobhe lya Mbone, na nenga mbate mota yake. <verse eid="1CO 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Bho, umanya jhe bhando pa bhabhutuka, bhoha bhabhutuka, nambo jhola jwabhalongolela bhajhake ndi jwapata hupo? Mmutuke yenio mpate hupo. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Mundo jhojhoha jwapala kwapeta bhajhake mukubhutuka, hote aghaleka ghoha, ahenga naha kupala apate hupo jhihangabhika! Nambo twenga tuhenga naha kwa nhwalo gwa kupata kilemba changahangabhika. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Yene nibhutuka ngita mundo jhumbala kwalongolela, nikomana jhe ngita mundo akomana na upepo. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Nambo ning'ahicha yegha jhango na kulongocha, nihenga yenio kupala pumbala kujhomolela kwatangachii bhando bhange ne namwete ngoto kukanilwa mukupoke hupo.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli ikanakiya kuijhinamii inyagho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Makalongo bhango, nipala umanye kubhehe akahoko bhito bhatyangita kongo bhalongwichwa na lihunde, na bhoha bhajhakujhomboka njelembo mbwane ngele. <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Bhoha bhakabatichwe bhabhehe bha Mucha mulihunde lela na mumbwane. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>Bhoha bhalila chakulyegha chechelachela cha kiuhuke, <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>helahela bhanywila chela cha kiuhuke, nhwalo bhakanywile kubhoke mulindalabho lya kiuhuke lilyakengima, lindalabho lyenio likibha Kilichitu jwenio. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Nambo, bhando bhamahele bhahengita jhe ilebhe yaipala Chapanga, na mahele bhakawile na malelo ghabhe ghakapechingine kunjenga.<verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Ngohe, mambu gheniya ghoha ndi nnandanikiho tugha kwito, ghatukelebhuwa kuhenga mabhoho ngita bheniya chibhahengita. <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>Nkoto kuijhinamii inyagho ngita bhange chibhahengita, ngita Majhandiko chighalonge, “Bhando bhakatamite mukulye na kunywegha, bhajhakujhema na kukina kingongola.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>Mwangatenda jhe ngongola, ngita bhange chibhatenda bhando bhange, lichiko limo bhando elufo ichilini na tato bhajhakukomolekelwa. <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>Nkoto kunnyigha Bhambo Kilichitu ngita bhando bhange chibhanyighita, bhoha bhakawile kwa kulumwa na lijhoka! <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>Nkotoka kukokoleka ngita bhando bhange chibhatehila, na bhene bhakakomilikilwa na ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga jwakoma!<verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Bhahe, mambu gheniya ghakapitile kupala twenga tubholwe, ghakajhandikwe kwa nhwalo gwa kutukanikiya twenga kubhehe machiko ghabhandikii kujhomolela.<verse eid="1CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Jwahambuka ajhemite nganganga, akilolekiye akotoka kugwegha! <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Majhighanikilo ghumpatite maghene jhe kwa bhando. Chapanga ndi jwahobholeka, jwenio anneka jhe mangota kupeta makakala ghino. Nambo pumujhighanikilwa, jwenio nampela makakala gha kuhimbalila na ndela jha kupitila.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Kwa nhwalo gwenio, makalongo bhango bhunimpala, ntame kutale na kujhinamila inyagho. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Nilonge na mangota ngita bhando bhina malango, uhwache mabhene gheniya ghinilongela. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Putunnomba Chapanga kwa kikombe chela cha mota, bho, tubhehe jhe pamonga mu miyahe jha Kilichitu? Na putumetula libumunda, bho, tubhehe jhe pamonga muyegha jha Kilichitu? <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Nhwalo libumunda lyenio limo, na twenga bhitubhii twe ndi yegha jhimo, nhwalo bhoha tulye libumunda lyenio.<verse eid="1CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>Dolekeya bhando bha ku Ichilahele bhene, bhala bhubhalila litambiko bhilombana na kachangwale kupete matambiko gheniya. <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Ngohe nilonge nike? Kubhehe chakulyegha chikitambikilwe inyagho ndi kikolongwa kuliku chakulyegha? Bho, na inyagho yenio itangatila nike? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Ng'oo! Chinilongela ndi chenje, litambiko lya bhando bhangaumanya Chapanga bhahipikiya michuka, nambo Chapanga jhe. Ne mbahijhe mangota mme maghumba nde na michuka. <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Mihotojhe kunywelekeya kikombi cha Bhambo na kongo mukinywelekeya kikombi cha michuka, mihoto ndeka kulye chakulyegha cha Bhambo na kongo mulye chakulya cha michuka. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>Bho, tupala Bhambo abhehe na wiho? Bho, miwacha tubhii na makakala kuliku jwenio?<verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uhenge ghoha kwa ukolongwa gwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>Bhando bhange bhilonge, “Ilebhe yoha ikanikiwa ndeka,” nambo ne nilonge yoha yamaha jhe. Peniya bhange bhalonge, “Ilebhe yoha ikanikiwa ndeka,” nambo ne nilonge ilebhe yoha jhe ichenga. <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Mundo jhojhoha pakate jhino akotoka kupalaya ghambone gha kuntangatii jwenio, nambo apalaha gha mbone kwa nhwalo gwa ajhake.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>Yoha ichuluchwa mulighuliho lya nyama mihoto kulye changakonyakonya nhwalo gwa kuhengeleka umiojho. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/>Nhwalo Majhandiko gha Chapanga ghilonge, “Nnema na ilebhe yoha ibhii nkate ndi ya Bhambo.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Anda mundo jwangannyeketela Kilichitu ankemangana mukalye kajhake, na mangota nnyeketile kujhenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:27">Nnyakile chochoha kichibhekitwe palonge jhino changakukonyakonya kwa nhwalo gwa mwojho ghino. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Nambo anda mundo jwannobholela mangota, “Chakulyegha chenje kitambikilwe inyagho,” mangalye jhe kwa nhwalo gwa jwenio jwannobholile na kwa nhwalo gwa mwojho. <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>Nilonge, Kwa nhwalo gwa mwojho gwa jhonge. Mundo jhonge anda ankonyite, “Nhwalo gwa nike kukombolelwa kwango kuhadabulwe na mwojho gwa mundo jhonge? <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Anda ninchenguu Chapanga kwa chinilyegha, nhwalo gwa nike mundo jhonge alongele ghangana ndela kwa kilebhe chenie chinichenguu Chapanga?”<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Bhahe, chochoha chimuhenga, kibhehe ndi kulye na kunywegha, ntende ghoha kwa ung'alicho gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Nkotoka kwatenda Akayahude amu kwa Akagilike amu kwa bhando bha Chapanga bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu bhakobondoke. <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>Mme ngita nenga, ne nipala kwahalalicha bhando bhoha kwa ghoha ghunihenga. Nhwalo nikipalakii jhe ghambone namwete tugha, nambo nipalaha kwa nhwalo gwa bhando bhoha bhakombolelwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>Ungengame nenga ngita nenga chininkengama Kilichitu.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kupuka muto pumunyinamii Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Ninumbalila nhwalo minngomboka kwa kila kilebhe na kughakamula malaghalikilo ghunipekii. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Nambo nipala kabhele mmanye kubhehe Kilichitu ndi muto gwa kila munalome, na munalome ndi muto gwa nhwana mundo, Chapanga ndi muto gwa Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Bhahe, kila munalome jwannyinamila Chapanga amu jwatangacha lilobhe lya Chapanga kongo apukite muto gwake jwampela hone Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Na mwikeghe jhojhoha pannyinamii Chapanga amu kutangacha malobhe gha Chapanga changapuka muto gwake, ampela hone munalome jwake, jwatehila naha tela tugha na mwikeghe jwachekwile majhunjo umuto. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Mwikeghe jwangapukita muto gwake, mbaha achekule majhunjo ghake. Nambo anda ibhii hone kwa mwikeghe kuchekula amu kupungucha majhunjo ghake, bhahe, mbaha apuke muto gwake. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Munalome yamaha jhe kupuka muto gwake, nhwalo jwenio ndi nnandanikiho gwa Chapanga na ung'alicho gwake Chapanga. Nambo mwikeghe ndi ung'alicho gwa munalome. <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Munalome apitii jhe kwa mwikeghe, nambo mwikeghe apitii kwa munalome. <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Munalome apanginwe jhe kwa nhwalo gwa mwikeghe, nambo mwikeghe apanganiwe kwa nhwalo gwa munalome. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Ndi nhwalo mwikeghe ipuka muto gwake kubhehe ukindendeke ghubhii panane jhake na kwa akatumiche bha kunane kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Helahela, palonge jha Bhambo mwikeghe akihobholela ndeka changa munalome, na jwenio munalome akihobholela ndeka changa mwikeghe. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Anda hela mwikeghe chapitila kwa munalome, helahela munalome abhelwike na mwikeghe, nambo kila kilebhe kihuma kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>Nnyomole mabhene, bho, chambone mwikeghe kunnyinamii Chapanga kongo apukite jhe kilebhe chochoha umuto gwake? <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Chapanga papangina ilangii hotu munalome kubhehe na majhunjo mandandamaho ndi hone jhake, <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>nambo kwa mwikeghe anda abhii na majhunjo mandandamaho, chenie ndi kilebhe chamaha kwa jwenio. Nhwalo apekilwe majhunjo mandandamaho ghampuke. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Mundo anda ipala kutaungana pakate jha lijhambu lende, twenga tukwete jhe ghutuyobhalile ghange, hilu bhando bha Chapanga bhubhahobhalile Kilichitu bhakwete jhe ghabhayobhalila ghange.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chakulyegha cha Bhambo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Matei 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maluku 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Mu malaghalikilo ghanga ghughahika ninombangana jhe, nhwalo mu makonganiko ghino gha kunnyinamii Chapanga mughatenda ghanganandela kuliku ghambone. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Pukutumbulila, pumukonganika pamonga upitii mpechangano pakate jhino, na nenga pandina nilipala lijhambu lende. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Ipalwa pabhehe na mpechangano pakate jhino, kupala bhala bhibhanyeketela Chapanga bhamanyikane. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Pumukonganika pamonga, mihola miilye chakulya cha kunkomboka Bhambo kone nahi jhe! <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Nhwalo pakulyegha, kila mundo alyegha changa lendelela bhange, ade bhange bhabhehe na njala kone bhange bhalobhile! <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Bho, mihoto jhe kulye na kunywegha kajha kwino? Amu bho, mwapechelecha bhando bha Chapanga bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu na kwapeke hone bhene bhanga kilebhe? Ngohe ninobholele nike? Bho, ninombe? Ng'oo! Ninomba jhe kwa lijhambu lende.<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Nhwalo nenga mbokii kuhumii kwa Bhambo malaghalikilo ghunimpekii, Bhambo Yecho pajhambilwa uhiko ghola, ajhakutola libumunda, <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>pajhomolila kunchenguu Chapanga, ajhakumetula, ajhakulonge, “Jhenjeno ndi yegha jhango jhunibhoha kwa nhwalo gwino mangota, ntende naha kwa kungomboka nenga.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Helahela pubhajhomolila kulyegha, ajhakutola kibaba, ajhakulonge: “Chenjeno ndi kibaba cha lilaghano liyono lya miyahe jhango. Ntende naha kila pumunywegha kwa kungomboka nenga.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Nhwalo kila mukulyegha libumunda na kunywela kibaba chenje, mutangacha kuwe kwa Bhambo, ade papalakuhika kabhele. <verse eid="1CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Yene, mundo jhojhoha jwalyegha libumunda hele amu kuinywela kibaba jha Bhambo changatopela, jwenio chabhehe atei uhakaho kwa yegha na miyahe jha Bhambo. <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Bhahe, kila mundo akilolekiye jwenio, peniya ndi ahoto kulyegha libumunda lende na kunywela kibaba chenie. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Nhwalo mundo jhojhoha jwalyegha na kunywegha abhehe na uchakaka ndi yegha jha Bhambo, changatenda yenio akiletela luhadabulo jwenio. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Ndi mana bhando bhamahele pakate jhino bhaleghelike na bhange bhilwalwa, na bhange bhajhomwike. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Anda tukihingukiye mbone, ngatuhadabwilwe jhe na Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Nambo putuhadabulwa na Bhambo, tubholwa kutama mbone, tukoto kuhadabulwa pamonga na bhando bhangaumanya Chapanga pannema.<verse eid="1CO 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Kwa ghanga, makalongo bhango, pumukukonganika kulye chakulya cha Bhambo, kila jhumo annendelela nnyake. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Mundo anda abhii na njala, alya kajhake, pumukonganika nkotoka kuhadabulwa na Chapanga. Nambo ghange, chinimmola pumbalakuhika.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Itoi kuhumii kwa Uhuke gwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Ngohe makalongo bhango,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:1">nipala umanye mbone kwa malobhe gha itoi kuhumii kwa Uhuke gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Mmanye kubhehe, mmanyite jhe Chapanga, mukalongwichwe mundela yanganandela kuijhinamii inyagho yanga bhehe na ughome. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Bhahe, nipala umanye kubhehe mundo jhojhoha jwalongochwa na Uhuke gwa Chapanga ahoto kulonge, “Yecho alapanikile!” Helahela, abhii jhe mundo jhojhoha jwahoto kulonge, “Yecho ndi Bhambo,” pangalongochwa na Uhuke gwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Ibhii itoi yamahele, nambo Uhuke jwaibhoha ndi jhumo. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Ibhii ndela yamahele mukunhengela, nambo Bhambo jwatunhengela ndi jhumo. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Ibhii ndela yamahele mukuhenga lihengo, nambo Chapanga ndi jhumo jwenio jwahenga mahengo ghoha kwa bhando bhoha. <verse eid="1CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Chapanga iyekulila kila mundo kwa kwatangatila bhando bhoha. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Uhuke ampekii jhumo malobhe gha malango, na Uhuke jhojho ampekii jhonge uhotolo gwa kumanya ilebhe ngita champala jwenio Uhuke. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Uhuke jhojho ampekii mundo kihobholelo, na Uhuke jhojho ampekii kitoi cha kwalamicha bhibhalwalwa, <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Uhuke gwa Chapanga ampekii jhonge uhotolo gwa kuhenga ikangacho, Uhuke jhojho ampekii jhonge uhotolo gwa kubhoha ulondole gwa Chapanga, na jhonge kulekanicha uhuke gwa Chapanga na yangabhehe ya Uhuke gwa Chapanga, jhonge alonge kwa lugha jhangamanyikana na jhonge kitoi cha kuchimulila chikilongelwa. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Lyenio lyoha ndi lihengo lya Uhuke jwenio jhumo, na jwenio imaghulila kila mundo kitoi ngita chapala jwenio.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yegha jhimo nambo ihungo yamahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Yegha ndi jhimo ipanginwe na ihungo yamahele, na pamonga ubhii na ilebhe yamahele, nambo ipangine yegha jhimo, yenio ndi chibhii kwa Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Nhwalo twenga tubatichwe kwa Uhuke ghumo tubhehe yegha jhimo, tubhehe Akayahude amu bhangabhehe Akayahude, tubhehe twakabhanda amu twakabhanda jhe, bhoha tunywelichwe Uhuke jhojho jhumo.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Yegha ipanginwe jhe na kihungo chimo, nambo ibhii ihungo yamahele. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Lukongono anda lulongela, “Nhwalo nenga nalubhoko jhe, bhahe nenga jwa yegha jhe,” bho, lukongono lubhehe lwa yegha jhe? Nahi jhe! <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Anda lichikilo lilongile, “Nhwalo nenga jwa liho jhe, bhahe, nenga jwa yegha jhe,” bho, nhwalo lichikilo jwa yegha jhe? Nahi jhe! <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Anda yegha jhoha ngaibhehe liho, nganyohine bho? Anda yegha jhoha ngaibhehe lichikilo, ngatunuite bho? <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Nambo Chapanga abhekite kila ihungo kila chehemo mu yegha ngita chapahile. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Ngita ihungo yoha anda ngakibhehe kihungo chimo, bho, yegha ngaibhii koo? <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Uchakaka ndi kubhehe, ibhii ihungo yamahele, nambo yegha ndi jhimo.<verse eid="1CO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Bhahe, liho lihoto ndeka kunnobholela lubhoko, “Nimpahi jhe mwe.” Hilu muto uhoto jhe kughalobholela makongono, “Ngwete malola na magholo.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Nambo kupeta gheniya, kubhehe ihungo yenio ya yegha ibhonekana kubhehe ileghelike, yenio ndi ipalwa hake. <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>Kabhele ihungo hela tulonge kubhehe yanganandela, ndi ibhekwa mbone hake, na ihungo ibhonekana yambone jhe tuighubikila mbone. <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>Nambo ihungo ibhonekana yambone hake, ipalwa jhe kulolekewa mbone. Chapanga jwenio abhekite yenio yegha, na chikipela utopaho chela chikiponokiwa, <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>kupala kwangabhehe jhe na mpechangano payegha, nambo ipagwa yoha itangatilane. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Anda kihungo chimo kilwalwa, bhahe, ipagwa yoha ilwalwa pamonga na chenie, anda kihungo chimo kilombwitwe, ihungo yoha ihangana pamonga na chenie.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Bhahe, mangota mabhoha ndi yegha jha Kilichitu, kila jhumo ndi kihungo cha yegha jhenie. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Mu lilongo lya bhando bhubhajheketii Kilichitu, hote Chapanga abhekite akatenga na jwa ubhele milondole bha Chapanga na jwa utato bhabhola na jwa ncheche bhala bhubhatenda ikangacho, bhala bhubhapekiwe makakala gha kwalamicha bhibhalwalwa, na bhubhahoto kwatangatii bhando bhange, peniya ilongoche na bhubhalonge lugha jhangamanyikana. <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Bho, bhando bhoha ndi akatenga? Bho, bhando bhoha ndi milondole bha Chapanga? Bho, bhando bhoha ndi bhabhola? Bho, bhando bhoha bhakwete kitoi cha kuhenga ikangacho? <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Bho, bhando bhoha bhakwete kitoi cha kulamicha bhando? Bho, bhando bhoha bhakwete kitoi cha kulonge lugha jhangamanyikana? Bho, bhoha bhichimulila lugha jhibhalongela? <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Yene mwipale hake itoi ibhii ikolongwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Na nenga ngohe chaninangiya ndela jha mbone hake kupeta yoha.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Mapalano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Pange nongele lugha jha bhando na lugha jha akatumiche bha kunane kwa Chapanga, nambo anda ngwete jhe upalo, bhahe, nenga nanandana na lipenenga lililela jhajhe amu nalingengecha. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Pange nkwete kitoi chukutangacha lilobhe lya Chapanga, na kumanya chile yoha na kumanya kila kilebhe, anda ngwete kihobholelo cha kubhoha itombe, nambo anda ngwete jhe upalo ne kilebhe nacho. <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Anda pange napekii akahocho ilebhe yango yoha nu kuibheka yegha jhango m umwotu itinike, nambo anda ngwete jhe upalo ne kilebhe nacho.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Mundo jwabhii na upalo uhimbilila, na ubhehe na kiya, akwete jhe wiho, akitondobhehe jhe hilu kuloka. <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>Mundo jhuna upalo utembekeya, akipalakii jhe yambone yake jwenio, hilu ajhojhoke jhe mulilaka, aghabheka jhe ghanganandela mumwojho, <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>mundo jhuna upalo ahanganii jhe ghangana ndela, nambo ahanganila gha ukwele. <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Mundo jhuna upalo ahimbalila yoha, ujheketela ghoha, uhobholela ghoha na ulepelela jhe na lyolyoha.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Upalo ujhomoka jhe. Anda kibhii kitoi cha ulondole gwa Chapanga chakijhomokela, anda kibhii kitoi cha kulonge kwa lugha jhangamanyikana, chenio nakujhomokela, anda kibhii kitoi cha kumanya, na chenie nakipeta. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Nhwalo kumanya kwito na kupiya kwito ulondole gwa Chapanga kupongwike. <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>Nambo chela chikitwelile pikipala kuhika, chela kipengwa nakihobholela.<verse eid="1CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Punikibha mwana king'enya, nongila ngita mwana, nikamanyite ngita mwana, nikawachii ngita mwana. Nambo pungolita nikaghalekite ghoha ghauhwana. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Chitukibhona ngohe ndi ngita kulolekeya mu lindala lela changabhonekana maha, nambo palonge natulola miho kwa miho. Nambo ngohe nimanya pandina tugha, peniya palonge chamanya ghoha ngita chighapalwa, ngita Chapanga chamanya nenga.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Ngohe ghatamakii mambu ghanga matato, kihobholelo na lihobholelo na upalo, nambo kilebhe kikolongwa kupeta ghoha ndi upalo.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s">Mabholo ghukujhojhekeya gha Uhuke gwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Nkengame upalo. Nambo jha kuchocha itoi ya kumwojho ya Uhuke gwa Chapanga, ngolongwa ndi kupiya ulondole gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Mundo jwalonge lugha yangamanyikana, jwenio alongii jhe na bhando nambo alonge na Chapanga, nhwalo abhii jhe mundo jwamanya chalongela, alonge mambu ghighahitwe kwa likakala lya Uhuke gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Nambo jhola jwapiya ulondole gwa Chapanga gwa kutangacha lilobhe lya Chapanga, ilonge na bhando na kwatangatila, kwa abhaleke na kwapepecha miojho. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Jwalongela lugha jhangamanyikana, akichenga jwenio, nambo jhola jwapiya ulondole gwa Chapanga, abhakangamalicha bhando bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu.<verse eid="1CO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Bhahe, nenga ngambahi mangota mabhoha nnongele kwa lugha jhangamanyikana, nambo chikipala hake ndi kupiya ulondole gwa kutangacha lilobhe lya Chapanga. Nhwalo mundo jhola jwapiya ulondole gwa lilobhe lya Chapanga ihenga ghambone kuliku jhola jwapiya ulondole gwa kulonge lugha jhangamanyikana, nambo anda abhii mundo jhonge jwahoto kuchimulila lugha jhangamanyikana kwa bhando bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu ahoto kwatangatila. <verse eid="1CO 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Ngohe makalongo bhango, anda hikite kwino nu kulonge na mangota kwa lugha jhangamanyikana, bho, nanyambulila nike? Chakaka nanyambulila jhe kilebhe! Nanyambulila anda nilonge na mangota kwa uyekulilo gwa Chapanga amu kumanya amu Lilobhe lya ulondole gwa Chapanga amu mabholo.<verse eid="1CO 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Anda ilebhe yangabhehe na ughome na ibhoha lilobhe, ngita kitolilo na lilimba. Bho, mundo naumanya bhole nhwambo ghuhonwa anda yombo yenio ibhoha lilobhe lyangamanyikana? <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Ngita lipenenga libhoha ndeka lilobhe lyamaha, ghane jwakilenganikiye kujhenda kungondo? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Helahela mangota, anda ghimulongela ghamanyikana ndeka, ghane nahotola bhole kumanya? Yene namma anda ilalama jhajhe. <verse eid="1CO 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Ibhii lugha mbwe pannema, nambo yoha ileta mana. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Nambo anda nenga nimanyite jhe chilonge mundo jhonge, nenga nibhehe naghene kwa mundo jwenio jhuilongela na nenga, na jwenio abhehe nng'ene kwa nenga. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Helahela mangota mabhoha, nhwalo mipala hake kupokela itoi ya Uhuke gwa Chapanga, nkangamale kujhonjekeya itoi itenda bhando bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu bhakangamale.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Mundo jhola jwalongela kwa lugha ngene, annyope Chapanga kitoi chakuhoto kwachimulila bhando chela chalongela. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Nhwalo, anda nyopite kwa lugha ngene, uhuke jhango ndi ghunyopa Chapanga, nambo malango ghango ghahenga ndeka kilebhe. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Ngohe ndenda bhole? Chanyopa kwa uhuke gwango, helahela chanyopa kwa malango ghango, chanyemba kwa uhuke gwango helehela chanyemba kwa malango ghango. <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Anda munnombalila Chapanga gwino kwa uhuke gwino tugha, anda abhii pakate jhino mundo jwangamanya chimulongela, nahotola bhole kukung'ila “Amina,” pumunchenguu Chapanga anda amanyiti chimulongela? <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Nahotola kunnomba Chapanga mbone, nambo jhola nakintangatila jhe kilebhe.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Ninnomba Chapanga nhwalo nenga nilongela lugha ngene kuliku mangota mabhoha. <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Nambo kwa lilongo lya bhando bhubhajheketii Kilichitu ngambaii kulonge malobhe nhwano ghighamanyikana, kwabhola bhando bhange kuliku kulonge malobhe ghamahele kwa lugha ngene.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Makalongo bhango, nkotoka kuwacha ngita yana ichokombe nambo mubhoho mme anda yana ichokombe, pumuwacha mme ngita bhando akanahota. <verse eid="1CO 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Ijhandikwe mu Malaghalikilo, “Bhambo alonge naha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">‘Kwa ndela jha bhubhalonge lugha ngene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">nanongela na bhando bhango alonge Bhambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">na kwa nnomo gwa akaghene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">chanongela na bhando bheniya, pamonga yenio nabhajhoha jhe.’ ”<verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Ngohe bhahe, kulonge lugha ngene, ndi nginyililo kwa bhando bhangajheketela, nambo chi kwa bhala bhubhajheketela Kilichitu. Nambo kupiya ulondole gwa Chapanga kwa nhwalo gwa bhala bhubhajheketii nambo kwa bhala bhangajheketela.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Bhahe, lilongo lya bhando bhoha bhubhajheketii Kilichitu pubhakonganika pamonga, na kila jhumo kutumbuu kulonge kwa lugha ngene, bhala bhangajheketela na bhangamanya kilebhe anda bhahikite, bho, nabhahola jhe kulonge mangota nkwete ngholoka? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Nambo bhoha bhubhapiya ulondole gwa Chapanga, bhando bhangajheketela na bhangamanya kilebhe anda bhahikite, nabhajhoha ghoha ghumulongela nabhamanya uhakaho gwabhe, na nabhahadabulwa na bhoha. <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>Na ilebhe yoha ihibhililwe miyojho jhabhe naibhaha pakongoloho, na bhene chatama makilikite na kunnyinamila Chapanga kone nabhalongela, “Chakaka Chapanga abhii pamonga na mangota.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilebhe ghane kihengeke mulilongo lya bhando bhubhajheketii Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Makalongo bhango, ngohe tulongele nike? Pumukonganika pamo kunnyinamii Chapanga, jhumo ajhemba nhwambo, na jhonge abhole, na jhonge abhehe na uloto kuhumii kwa Chapanga, na jhonge alongela lugha ngene na jhonge achimulila ghighalongelwa. Ghoha ghahengeke kwa nhwalo gwa kwatangatila lilongo lya bhando bhubhajheketii Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Anda bhabhii bhando bhakulonge lugha ngene, bhabhele amu bhatato bhalongela, nambo alonge jhumo jhumo, na kongo abhii mundo jhonge jwa kwachimulila chikilongelwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Nambo anda abhii jhe mundo jwa kwachimulila chikilongelwa, bhahe, mundo jhola jwalongela lugha ngene atame nuu mulilongo lya bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu, alonge mumwojho gwake na Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Bhando bhabhele amu bhatato bhubhatangacha Malobhe gha Chapanga, bhahoto kulonge bhabhele amu bhatato, bhange bhakoto kuhadabula malobhe ghala ghighalongelwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Anda abhii mundo mulilongo lyenio jwapokii Malobhe gha Chapanga, bhahe, jhola jwalongela atame nuu. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Nhwalo mangota mabhoha mihoto kupiya ulondole gwa Chapanga jhumo jhumo, kila mundo akibhola na akangamalichwe mwojho. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Ihuke ya milondole bha Chapanga ijhoha milondole bha Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>Nhwalo Chapanga chi Chapanga jwakuhenga ilebhe ya bhulo, nambo jwenio ndi Chapanga jwa uteeke.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Helahela anda mulilongo lya bhando lilinyeketii Kilichitu, <verse eid="1CO 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>akakeghe bhatame nuu mu malilongo gha bhando ghighannyeketii Kilichitu, bhakotoka kulonge, hilu kulongocha anda lilaghalikilo chililongela. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Anda bhapala kunkonya, bhankonye akangana bhabhe kajhabhe, nhwalo hone kwa mwikeghe kulonge chochoha palilongo lya bhando lilinyeketii Kilichitu.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Bho, miwacha Lilobhe lya Chapanga lihumita kwino amu lihikite kwa mangota kanjika tugha? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>Anda mundo jhojhoha awacha kubhehe apekiwe Malobhe gha Chapanga, amu kitoi chenge cha Uhuke gwa Chapanga, amanye kubhehe ghanga ghinijhandika ndi nhwilo gwa Bhambo. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Nambo mundo aghapucha ghanga, bhahe, nkoto kunholela mundo jwenio.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Bhahe, makalongo bhango, mme na unoghe hake kupiya ulondole gwa Chapanga, nambo nkotoka kwakanakiya bhando kulonge kwa lugha ngene. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Nambo ghoha ghahengeka mbone kila kilebhe ngita chiipalwa.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyoka kwa Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Ngohe makalongo bhango, mbala kunkombocha Malobhe gha Mbone ghunintangachila, ghimpokii na kubhehe nchinge gwa kuhobholela kwino, na kwa gheniya mangota nnyemite nganganga. <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Lilobhe lyenio linintangachii ndi Lilobhe lya Mbone, mangota nang'ombokoka anda mughakamwii maha ghala ghunintangachila, anda nahi jhe bhahe, kuhobholela kwino jhajhe.<verse eid="1CO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Nenga nikampekii mangota ghala ghimbokii nenga namwete, kubhehe Kilichitu awile kwa nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwito ngita chighalonge Majhandiko gha Chapanga, <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>kubhehe awile na kuyoka lichiko lya utato ngita chighalonge Majhandiko gha Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>Akatumbwii kumpitii Kefa, kabhele ajhakwapitila akatenga kome na bhabhele. <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Helahela ajhakwapitila akalongo mamiya nhwano kwa mala jhimo, bhamahele bhabhii ghome, nambo bhange bhajhomwike. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Paligha ajhakumpitila Yakobu, na peniya ajhakwapitila akatenga bhoha.<verse eid="1CO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Kujhomolela kwake ajhakumbitii nenga, ngita mundo jhumelwikwe changatimicha miyehe jhango. <verse eid="1CO 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Nhwalo nenga ndi natenga jwandina pakate jha akatenga bhoha, nitope jhe kukemwa natenga, nhwalo nakaghang'ahite makunde gha bhando ghighanyeketii Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Nambo, kwa umbone gwa Chapanga, undei mme ngita chimile, na umbone gwake ukibha jhajhe jhe. Nenga hengite lihengo kupete akatenga bhoha, ne jhe, nambo umbone gwa Chapanga uhengita lihengo pamonga na nenga. <verse eid="1CO 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Kwa nhwalo gwenio, ibhehe nenga amu bheniya bhubhatangacha Malobhe gha Mbone kilebhe jhe, chenje ndi twatangachila bhando na chenje ndi chitujheketela.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyoka kwa bhando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Ngohe, nhwalo itangachwa kubhehe Kilichitu ayokite kubhoke mu kuwegha, bho, nhwalo ghane bhange bhilonge kubhii jhe kuyoka? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Anda kubhii jhe kuyoka kwa bhando, bhahe, Kilichitu na jwenio ayokite jhe, <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>anda Kilichitu ayokite jhe, bhahe, chituntangacha kilebhe nacho, helahela kihobholelo chino kilebhe nacho. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Kupeta gheniya, helahela twenga tubhonekana tulongii uwange panane jha Chapanga, kwa nhwalo tulongii Chapanga akayokiche Kilichitu, chakaka akayokiche jhe, ngita hela bhubhawile bhahyokichwa jhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Nhwalo ikibha chakaka kubhehe bhubhawile kuyoka jhe, bhahe na jwenio Kilichitu ayokite jhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Anda Kilichitu ayokite jhe, bhahe, kihobholelo chino kilebhe nacho, na mwamela muhakaho gwino. <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Helahela bhando bhubhawile kone bhannyeketii Kilichitu bhahobhalile. <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Anda tuhobhalila Yecho Kilichitu muughome ghongo tugha, twenga tupalwa kubhonelwa kiya kuliku bhando bhoha pannema.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Nambo uchakaka ndi kubhehe Kilichitu ahyokichwe kuhumii muweghe, jwenio ndi jwatumbulila kuyoka pakate jha bhando bhubhagholwike mukuwegha. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Anda kuwegha kuletitwa na mundo jhumo, helahela kuyoka kubhoke muweghe na kwenie kuletitwa na mundo jhumo. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Kwa nhwalo bhando bhoha bhiwegha kwa kulombana na Adamo, helahela kwa kulombana na Kilichitu bhando bhoha bhabhehe ghome. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Nambo kila jhumo chayoka mu kipinde chake, kutumbulii Kilichitu, peniya bhala bhubhabhii bhake Kilichitu papakuhika. <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Peniya, kujhomolela nakuhika, Kilichitu papakumpe Chapanga Tate unahota nkolongwa, pajhomolela kuhangabhana ulongoche na ukindendeke na makakala ghoha ghanganandela. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Nhwalo Kilichitu apalwa kulongocha ade Chapanga pahotola kwabula akamakoko bhoha na kwabheka pahe jha makongono ghake. <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Likoko lya kujhomolela jwapala kukomolekelwa ndi kuwegha. <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>Nhwalo Majhandiko gha Chapanga ghilonge, “Chapanga abhekite ilebhe yoha pahe jha makongono ghake.” Nambo, Majhandiko pighalonge, “Ilebhe yoha ibhekitwe pahe jha makongono gha ilongoche,” chakaka kubhehe Chapanga abhii jhe muilebhe yenio, nhwalo jwenio Chapanga ndi jwaibheka ilebhe yoha pahe jha ukindendeke gwa Kilichitu na ahoto jhe kubhehe pahe jha Kilichitu. <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Nambo papala kubheka pahe jha ulongoche gwa Kilichitu, na jwenio Mwana chatama pahe jha ulongoche gwa Chapanga, jwabhekite yoha pahe jha ulongoche gwake, nhwalo Chapanga ilongocha yoha kila chehemo.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Ngohe anda kuyoka kubhii jhe, bho, bhando bhala bhubhatichwa kwa nhwalo gwa bhubhawile nabhatenda bho? Anda bhubhawile bhayokichwa jhe, nhwalo ghane bhando bhibatichwa kwa nhwalo gwabhe? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Nhwalo ghane na twenga tukibheka ngenyangenya jha ngondo kila lichaa? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Makalongo bhango, machiko naghabhaha mukuhandahanda jha ngondo jha kuwegha! Nikiloka kwa nhwalo gwino mu kulombana na Yecho Kilichitu Bhambo gwito, ghindenda nnonge ghanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>Bho, nganyambulile kilebhe ghane pangomina na bhando bhubhalandine na inyama ijhoghowa kwenio ku Epecho? Nambo anda bhando bhubhawile nabhahyokichwa jhe bhahe, “Tulye na tunyweghe, nhwalo kilabho natuhwa.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Nkotoka kukopokelwa, “Ukoche gwanganandela uhangabhana luhomo lwambone.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Ngohe ung'ang'anuke! Nkoto kutenda uhakaho, nhwalo bhando bhange pakate jhino chakaka bhammanyite jhe Chapanga. Nilonge mambu ghanga nkola hone!<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yegha jha kuyoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Nambo mundo ahotola kukonya, “Bho, bhubhawile bhayoka bhole? Bho, chibhabha na yegha ghane?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Ngonyelo jhene jha kimbebhebhe! Mbejho yumichite imela jhe ade ihwe hote. <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Paumichita, umicha mbejho tugha, ibhe ya ngano amu mbejho henge, umicha jhe mmea ghupitila. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Chapanga haipela mbejho liumbo lyalipala jwenio, kila mbejho libhehe na liumbo lya kanjika chake.<verse eid="1CO 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Yegha ihumbi yoha ilandine jhe. Bhando bhakwete yegha jhabhe na inyama ikwete yegha yabhe, ijhune ikwete yegha yabhe na helahela homba ikwete yegha yabhe.<verse eid="1CO 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Kabhele yegha ya kunane kwa Chapanga na yegha ya pannema, uwalanao gwa yegha ya kunane kwa Chapanga ilandinejhe na uwalanao yegha ya pannema. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Lyobha libhii lya mbone na lubhalamwehe lubhii lwa uwalanaho na ndondwa ibhii na uhwalanaho gwake, na ndondwa yenio ilandinejhe muhwalanao.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Yene ndi chipala kubhehe bhando pubhapala kuyokichwa kwa bhando bhubhawile. Yegha uchikwa kone ubholite, nambo uyoka changahangabhika. <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>Uchikwa muhone, uhyokechwa muukolo, uchikwa kone uleghelike, uyokichwa mumakakala. <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Pauchikwa, uchikwa anda yegha jha umundo, peniya uyoka yegha jha kiuhuke. Anda ibhii yegha jha kiumundo, helahela ibhii yegha jha kiuhuke. <verse eid="1CO 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>Nhwalo Majhandiko gha Chapanga ghalongela, “Mundo jwa kutumbula, Adamo, akibha mundo ghome,” nambo Adamo jwa kujhomolela ndi Uhuke gwa Chapanga jwabhapekea bhando ughome. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Yegha jha kiuhukejhe jhilongolile, nambo yegha jha kiumundo ndi ulongolile, peniya ijhakuhika yegha jha kiuhuke. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Mundo jwakutumbulila akapanginwe kuhumii mulutukunda lwa nnema, nambo mundo jhubhele abhokite kunane kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Bhando bha pannema bhalandine na bhala bhapanginwe kwa undope, na bhala bhahumita kunane kwa Chapanga ndibhahumite kunane kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Anda yenio chitulandine na jhola jwapanginwe kwa undope, helahela chatulandine na jhola jwahumita kunane kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Bhahe akalongo bhango chinilongela ndi chenje, chela chikipanginwe kwa yegha na miyahe kihotolajhe kubhujhila unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga, hilu chela chikihangabhika kihotolajhe kuleka kuhangabhika.<verse eid="1CO 15:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>Nyokanikihe, ninobholele chile, bhoha natujhomoka ndeka, nambo bhoha natughalambulwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>Chwechwele kuchichila na kuhumbula anda liho pulikopekopela. Nhwalo lipenenga la kujhomolela pilipala kulela, bhubhawile chibhayokichwe kone yegha jhabhe ibholitejhe, peniya na twenga natuwejhe, nambo natughalambulwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Nhwalo yegha jhihangabhika ipalwa ughalambuke kubhehe gwangahangabhika, yegha jhiwegha ighalambuke kubhehe jhangawegha. <verse eid="1CO 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Bhahe, yegha jhenje jhihangabhika puighalambuka ikoto kuhangabhika, na chela chikibhii mukuwegha pakighalambuka kikoto kuwegha, peniya ndi chilitimile Lilobhe lya Chapanga lililongela, “Kuwegha kukomalikilwe, kituhotojhe kabhele!”<verse eid="1CO 15:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>“Mwe kuwegha, bho, kuhoto kwino kubhii ko?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Mwe kuwegha bho, lipyanda lino libhii ko?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Kuwegha kubhehe na likakala nhwalo gwa uhakaho, na uhakaho libhehe na makakala nhwalo gwa lilaghalikilo. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Nambo tunchenguu Chapanga jwatupekii likakala kupetela Bhambo gwito Yecho Kilichitu.<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Bhahe akalongo bhango, nnyemengane nganganga changa nyukunyuka. Machiko ghoha nnyendelele kuhenga lihengo lya Bhambo, nhwalo umanya kubhehe lihengo lino kwa kuntumikii Bhambo lya jhajhe jhe.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s">Nchango gwa kwatangatii bhando bhubhajheketii Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Ngohe, nilongele malobhe gha kwachangii bhando bha Chapanga, ntende chenie ngita chinililobholile kwa lilongo lya bhando lilinyeketii Kilichitu lya ku Galatiya. <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Kila jumapile, kila mundo pakate jhino abheke mbijha yabhii nako, peniya abheke kihukilo nhwalo pambala kuhika kukoto kubhehe na nchango kabhele. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Peniya pumbala kuhika kwino, nanatuma bhala bhimahagwile pakate jhino bhapeleke nchango na baluwa ku Yeluchalemo. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>Anda tela na nenga kujhenda kwenio, natulongohana pamonga.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mambu ghapala kuhenga Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Pumbala kupeta kujhenda ku Makedoniya, hote natumbula kuhika kwino, nhwalo mbala kujhenda ku Makedoniya. <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Pange nihoto kutama na mangota pandina, amu kutama na mangota mu machiko ghoha gha malile, nhwalo undangatile mumwanja gwango kokoha kunijhenda. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Nipala ndeka kukongana na mangota kwa kupeta tugha, mbala ndame na mangota pandina anda Bhambo apahile.<verse eid="1CO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Nambo chandama pamba ku Epecho ade lichiko lya Pendekochite, <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>nhwalo nnyango gwango ubhii gwampala kwa lihengo lyango likolongwa pamba, anda bhabhii bhando bhamahele bhubhakana ghunilongela.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>Timocheyo anda ahika kwino, nkotoka kuntenda ajhoghope patama na mangota, nhwalo jwenio ahenga lihengo lya Bhambo ngita nenga. <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Yene mundo jhojhoha nkotoka kupucha, nambo mutangatile ajhendelele tela na mwanja gwake kwa nhwalo ahotole kubhujha kabhele kwa nenga, nhwalo ninendelela abhujhe na bhando bhango.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Ngohe nongele malobhe gha nnongo gwito Apolu, nde kumpembelekeya ahike kwino pamonga na akalongo bhange, nambo apala jhe kuhika ngoheno, nambo chahika papata pwache.<verse eid="1CO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malobhe gha kujhomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Nkeluwe, ntamangane maha mu kihobholelo chino, nkangamale mme na makakala. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Kila kilebhe chimukihenga kihengwa kwa upalo.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Makalongo bhango mmanye Sitefano na bhando bha kajha jhake, bheniya ndi bhando bhubhakatumbwii kupokela kihobholelo cha Kilichitu ku kilambo cha ku Akaya, peniya bhakipihite bhene kwa kwahengela bhando bha Chapanga. Yene makalongo bhango nimpembelekeya, <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>mwajhokanikiye bhando ngita bheniya, na kila mundo ahenga lihengo pamonga nabho.<verse eid="1CO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Nihanganila hake pubhahikita Sitefano na Fotunato na Akaiko, nhwalo pubhakibha pamba tela na mangota kubhehe pamba. <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>Nhwalo bhauhanganiche uhuke gwango ngita chinihanganiche mangota. Kwa nhwalo gwenio ipalwa kwakomboka bhando ngita bheniya.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Bhando bhoha bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu bha ku Asiya bhanyambucha. Akula na Pilisila pamonga na likunde lya bhando bhoha bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu bhubhakonganika kujhopa kajhango bhanyambucha kwa liina lya Bhambo. <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Makalongo bhoha bhubhabhii pamba bhinyambucha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Na mangota nnyambuchane mabhene kwa mabhene kulangii upalo gwa Kilichitu.<verse eid="1CO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Nenga Napauli ninyambucha, kongo ninyandikila ujhambucho ghongo kwa lubhoko lwango namwete.<verse eid="1CO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Mundo jhojhoha jwangampala Bhambo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:22">jwenio akilapanikii MARA NATHA. Bhambo gwito ahika!<verse eid="1CO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Umbone gwa Bhambo Yecho Kilichitu ubhaha pamo na mangota.<verse eid="1CO 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Upalo gwango utame na mangota mabhoha bhunombine na Kilichitu Yecho.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
